{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_title", "source_sha256": "169b0282e5b82961adfa9ed6b3a87cc5b2b7afc03d2d1b15161d9b2c40b5f735", "ja": "そして、少女は羽化する", "zh": "而后，少女羽化成蝶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74cd038ab2efbfa71bc8619aa0a976790ae27bc3eb4ae3070f765aa020b70f01", "ja": "可憐なモデル仕事を終えたばかりの真に、\n少年役でのドラマの出演依頼が届く。可愛い\nイメージが広まったばかりなのにと心配する\nプロデューサー。自分の魅力について考えた\n真は、そのドラマの出演を引き受ける。", "zh": "刚结束了楚楚可怜的模特工作的真，\n收到了在电视剧中出演少年角色的邀请。真可爱的\n形象才刚传开，制作人对此有些担心。\n而思考了自身魅力的真，\n接下了那部电视剧的出演工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "df1a9db55490c14a2befa95e946ee0d9640948561e23c568b7b8046b3b6d75e7", "ja": "みんな、見に来てくれてありがとうー！\n今日のボクは、どうだったー？", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们来看我——！\n今天的我，表现得怎么样——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1001_null", "source_sha256": "e18f480d17a1f9f74aef206a7f74e964b88923865b1f01357eccf5798cb35ada", "ja": "ワァァァァ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "3f88b5f3559d2066194f1c56f4e59cae7dfc067aecec07c160e53f5095e90484", "ja": "へへっ、ありがとう♪\nよろこんでもらえたみたいで、ボクもうれしいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪  \n你能喜欢，我也很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "c6c467247fcc33ed4a6eb8b46c736fcf5c661872888e49f2d9d39280063c64db", "ja": "いま聞いてもらった『自転車』って曲は、\nボクが出演しているドラマでも使われてるんだけど。", "zh": "刚才请你听的《自行车》这首歌，也被用在了我出演的电视剧里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "356ff7f209ad923bc62c5fc6d4acc3a44fdec07904a878cfe79405bc3d8f8427", "ja": "ボクのカケル、それからライバルのハルト……\nふたりの思いを、表してるみたいな曲だと思うんです！", "zh": "我觉得，这首歌就像是在表达我家卡克尔，还有对手哈尔特……两个人的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "2105e4658980b073d662d917224af2a3aa0f4c45cdad5f81cb92e7c18f8e34f4", "ja": "ドラマも、これからすごい展開になるから期待してて！\nあっ！　漫画の方もすっごく面白いから、読んでね！", "zh": "电视剧接下来也会有超精彩的发展，敬请期待！\n啊！漫画版也超级有趣，要记得看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "e4b904728ec5fa1f15e602b49dfd2dfe9265645c26f84332e9b218b6033ab743", "ja": "ワァァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0794463aa09e3f0bccea258fc910679be51d41b0e5ef64002a04c3216f749685", "ja": "（真のセンター公演は、無事、大盛況で終わった。\n曲がドラマにも使われたせいか、盛り上がったな！）", "zh": "（真担任中心的公演顺利地圆满结束了。也许是因为歌曲还被用在了电视剧里，现场气氛真热烈啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3834bf8ac70f91519e9acb0591e96cbf0e98bf8ed93df88badc57b58a69c553", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\nどうでしたか？　ボクの公演！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n感觉怎么样？我的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2c8735f678f13a342b320398e41eeed214b839f305f058006e22f8d4e348adf", "ja": "お疲れさま、真！　よかったよ。\n特に、『自転車』の盛り上がりはすごかったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，真！很棒哦。尤其是《自行车》的现场气氛特别热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "010ea7fd09d6bf908914f6383b2cbada15e5e592fce53486e17d0525e42822cf", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思いましたか？\nボクも、『自転車』が一番だったなって！", "zh": "{$P$}也这么觉得吗？\n我也觉得《自行车》是最棒的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f41348dcaa8add6389ac0bf88c7d523f389139bb746fbf3f771169ae63d10994", "ja": "心なしか、いつもより女性ファンも多かったし……\nドラマを見て、興味をもってくれたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "总觉得女粉丝也比平时更多……\n可能是看了电视剧之后，对你产生兴趣了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4c309e8c2b3c32183016afd8476ba3f7242de7036c88747685d22007fb99d5ef", "ja": "けど、まさか真の曲をドラマの挿入歌として\n使ってもらえるとは、思わなかったな。", "zh": "不过，没想到真小姐的歌竟然能被选作电视剧的插曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "c25cd5570ca903ae48378b1c5a9490a5a0f0790dfb2fd52fce7d69873b639ab5", "ja": "そうですね！　曲の効果で、話題性バッチリだし……\n一石二鳥、って感じですよね♪　へへっ！", "zh": "没错！多亏了歌曲的效果，话题度也十足……\n感觉真是一石二鸟呢♪嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "06d634c2c2680f85b650d7cbf3805cdbef3b455ceae9610f8aa464adb30ef0b9", "ja": "真さ～ん！\nすっごく、すーっごくカッコよかったです……！", "zh": "真——！\n真的、真的帅呆了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "e8b5581ecc24dcf359c8c37ceb564fe073cdc7813f0b68333a026374ea7d3519", "ja": "姫も、真ちゃんから目が離せなかったのです。\n今日の主役は、真ちゃんに決まりなのです！", "zh": "公主的目光也完全离不开小真呢。\n今天的主角，非小真莫属了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "54abb92fbcc80858a5cae2906542364de37b6df57e9fbd522503bfbf6aaf3494", "ja": "主役……そ、そうかな？\nあ、みんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "主角……真、真的吗？\n啊，大家都辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "1ab51e2e27093f98df848bd36eb28ee1fd70286138f4fabe87356026d57ee1d4", "ja": "あたしも、真さんじゃなくて、本物のカケル君と\n一緒にステージに立ってるみたいな気がしたよぉ。", "zh": "我也觉得，自己好像不是和真先生，而是和真正的Kakeru一起站在舞台上似的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "5e054bb001b1a5060dd7ff7dfff0a72a605e57a79e88c789cc2cf3642823077c", "ja": "実は、私も……。真ちゃんの横顔にドキッとして、\nタイミングを間違えそうになっちゃった……。", "zh": "其实我也是……看到小真的侧脸，心跳不由得漏了一拍，\n差点就搞错时机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "26b7ea83a5a56807a45d51913b90553a1532bab0ba3aaf881e6248cee14ace91", "ja": "ええっ、ホントに？　でも、みんなにそんなふうに\n言ってもらえるなんて、なんだかうれしいなぁ……。", "zh": "诶，真的吗？不过，能听到大家这么说，不知怎么的还真让人高兴啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "029c971142b2d0afe307fdc09484af8186efede1bd79467000aa98feed7c1e7a", "ja": "みんな、今日は本当にありがとう！\n公演が楽しかったのは、みんなのおかげだよ！", "zh": "大家，今天真的很谢谢你们！\n公演能这么开心，多亏了大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1021_p", "source_sha256": "32470270af99959a4c74c12db4e8100c3974711227c69caf90e9ea9c1738e2cc", "ja": "よし、そろそろ撤収準備をしよう。\nこの後は打ち上げだから、みんな着替えてくるように！", "zh": "好，差不多该准备撤场了。\n之后还有庆功宴，大家快去换衣服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "好的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1027_p", "source_sha256": "4fd817c8641ca51d6adcab44162a6df0525b0d444f13aa6759bf911798c3843e", "ja": "あっ、真！　少しいいか？", "zh": "啊，真！能耽误你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "94fd369f05f093f5efa623a2b27fb207b5cb1e2f5d102fb62109a16e557615dc", "ja": "{$P$}？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}？　怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6e620afc0a8947e0206c6156856ef39a9374905aa7e8ed62a9e125336b9fa5b9", "ja": "今回、真が勇気を出してくれたおかげで、\n公演もドラマも成功したと思う。本当にありがとう！", "zh": "多亏这次真鼓起了勇气，我觉得公演和电视剧都成功了。真的谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "1614fc2509fb416c2600f346881041378aa62cb0261780121fe46dc537247eb3", "ja": "や、やだな～、{$P$}！\nお礼を言われるようなことじゃないですよ！", "zh": "讨厌啦，{$P$}！\n这哪用得着跟我道谢呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "7572a447ec3245916e7caae8d2c5c09d38f35709bb879dda74125630b95f713c", "ja": "それに、ボクにもちょっと考えっていうか……\n作戦がありましたからね！", "zh": "而且，我也稍微想了想……或者说，已经有作战计划了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a26c09d2e3f602cf0fde0295499f2c38b85d7b22a861c63613271d10380fef89", "ja": "作戦？", "zh": "作战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "6c1c35a072045c2df5a6dc8a5e9526b361d5aaa3a8f4580342e9445e496cee68", "ja": "はい！　『キミさけ』のカケルって、見た目はちょっと\n不良っぽいですけど、繊細で優しいじゃないですか。", "zh": "是的！《キミさけ》里的Kakeru，外表虽然有点像不良少年，但其实很细腻、很温柔，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "05f66f2e4e065c6b9497ccf8a88197c47fec86dd033ecf37eecb33426414855f", "ja": "それでボク、思ったんです。\n「人って、見た目どおりなだけじゃないんだな」って。", "zh": "所以我就想，人并不只是看起来的样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "a951493b974c7e5020964462401ecf06ce93298fbe8d4e352fc8c33cbe8a08ff", "ja": "それに、あんな妖精さんみたいなボクに、\nカッコイイ仕事が来たんですから……。", "zh": "而且，像我这样宛如小精灵一般的女生，竟然也接到了帅气的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "d60c7148dc19212fb9ce517cf619cdefb12da49ef239fe0700d5ca7604189fa5", "ja": "今度は反対に、カッコイイボクを見た人から、\nカワイイお仕事が来るかも！？　……なんて！", "zh": "这次反过来，说不定看到了帅气的我之后，就会有可爱的工作找上门来！？……之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1037_p", "source_sha256": "43fe85c508a7ae124c7385f856344959781a662324f411cd3c867a29db2e23f3", "ja": "なるほど……うん、いい作戦だな！\n流石は真だ。", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，这个作战不错！\n不愧是真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_061_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "4e91d977ff67c12f98ba37f41789917f2cc37e4f348d917cb344e792c090c1a6", "ja": "それに{$P$}、ボクにドラマの\n仕事の話をする時、すごく迷ってましたよね？", "zh": "而且{$P$}，你之前要跟我谈电视剧的工作时，也犹豫了很久吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
